1. Definitions

   "Evaluation Purposes" means evaluating, analyzing, reviewing, testing,
   benchmarking and cryptanalyzing the algorithms; academic research and teaching;
   and participation in the evaluation of the Next-generation Commercial
   Cryptographic Algorithms Program (NGCC) of the Institute of Commercial
   Cryptography Standards (ICCS).

